{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/7xjhkv81g3jn0vxvuxlhjelu4e0evll.mp3","text":"要好好听我的话哦，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/16de5mlugmnnxcrvjn4mbpdf92px0m0.mp3","text":"这个香气，怎么样？是不是有种，被治愈了的感觉？多亏玫兰莎给我的样品，我才获得了这种灵感。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/df/hz9vlxu70qqz9e0kqzrfb8harcth3df.mp3","text":"谢谢您帮我建设花卉温室，我想，这里会是大家都能放松休息的好地方。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/on7rhc48m1snlzotui8v7x0r3yhljuq.mp3","text":"啊，您醒了吗？是不是一点疲惫都感觉不到了？看来我新调制的香薰起了作用。毕竟，这也算是我的自信之作呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/23/hkyt78rq07wrcw2rps3y3z1gaj1cvcc.mp3","text":"水仙、燕子花、长寿花、波罗尼——这些用来培育花朵的种子，我总是会随身携带的哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/rpme2gnm8pgljhmlnbwtcidgnaf7g46.mp3","text":"哎？您问这孩子吗？虽然它还很小，不过，她可总能在调制过程中帮上大忙呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/t8q63k395jlw3zpac3r42kv070qc8sk.mp3","text":"蚂蚁们的社会关系，是依靠气味来维持的吧？我觉得调香师和顾客的关系也是如此。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/37w920mgpns75ydvhrldiivv8fk94u3.mp3","text":"最近您经常来温室做客呢......哎呀，您的袖口，沾着些花粉哟？好，已经帮您擦掉了~","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/50/6i47367q35umraxr9iq5xm4kthes7qx.mp3","text":"您好像睡了很久呢，这次，又做了什么样的梦呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/53zatonbn5kuapn7vwvstgz8kfglddz.mp3","text":"嗯，博士？哎，薰衣草的效果，超乎我的意料呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/q6f7zj9abdk1v1lp4u5l644jzmr93lt.mp3","text":"初次见面，博士。我是调香师莱娜。您听说过调香师这种职业吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/8p2verl3nsuwmqwdjtrwie4bftzytep.mp3","text":"就拜托您检验我的成果了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/1jjth0tmx2iqui6paep0zsfgaqf8p5n.mp3","text":"有关晋升的消息......您是特意来向我传达这个的吗？真是不好意思，博士......啊，抱歉，请稍等。没事，只是您的领角皱了，我稍微整理了一下~","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/jmb20mjt1k42fhirw66kqmzj7z30uti.mp3","text":"其实我不太适合那些蛮不讲理的战斗方式。不过，如果是为了博士，我也是会去努力适应的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/jyv3ayr9fwxtwcf6cs5oubmhl59ejxv.mp3","text":"非常乐意。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/0fdx7k6khpykv0srzqmeio4dwt039l8.mp3","text":"调香与治疗，无论哪一项工作，我都会让博士您满意的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/mipy1ta9wql10arqbyd5uy79xu23mse.mp3","text":"大家，千万要注意安全。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/3nx5havhuvtamwk095xbey3rjvzu6hl.mp3","text":"这会是一场怎样的战斗呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/lr4u7izpcj57d5zh8qvjj5st5crzu5c.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/c419z1zinh1gpcg48ntpb861bz2f9po.mp3","text":"我没问题的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/45h36zn8dm9xp1643riqz2tzyraanwx.mp3","text":"这就是战场啊。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/37/a823v6xakz6iu97sol93tgnx5f0kpch.mp3","text":"我不会害怕的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/14lo4jcs8vkztybh2b4zrcde8cn2oav.mp3","text":"恢复神智吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/12grkg35yy1rsh4o97zpxbxyifo18je.mp3","text":"打起精神来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/309xdwgoynshw3x4yyc6xhm30val9to.mp3","text":"喜欢这种香味吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/7878c2hlda85aqrp3sf06l89h0v7f8e.mp3","text":"冷静一些哪。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/5an5lyobluyhj8ox29xdwu9aowxcpin.mp3","text":"我一直都相信啊，只要是博士来担任指挥的话，我们就一定会获胜的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/35rbr3tn4p1wovchy6akts4ec7nfgd6.mp3","text":"真是太好了，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/kombhpzwo85iub1f07id0dacdv5f30n.mp3","text":"大家辛苦了，请好好休息下吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/tmeiajpckmg1j8edumlglbrt9jngmkh.mp3","text":"虽然没能赢下战斗确实有些遗憾，但我是不会气馁的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/ojjm2g3zd821q75twpex2zyckcjwo4m.mp3","text":"还是博士的身边，最适合我呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/i8lpu4lqk2zwyu4kge714m5cins7f5r.mp3","text":"哎呀。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/gmkpryo8gmn31x80pugerb3g36yfvgd.mp3","text":"博士身上......有着美妙的香气呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/9s3819qz4r248yc2pm7pq143v5hjv8z.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/ev7dbik1y2o6cbb09ktubueep5ekbvm.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。新年用的花卉就放在这里，可以吗？这些花的花期虽然只有四天，但只要有我在，博士的房间里，一年四季都会充满花香与色彩的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/0fgencea4bwezqlur7iiv0wmmziyo0m.mp3","text":"博士，您好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_181_flower/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/fotha4vxwr5c4bzcmyfsj94u9nh4lkj.mp3","text":"要好好听我的话哦，博士。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/2xu81u7dz1bg2awvka1j0b1si41mpu0.mp3","text":"这个香气，怎么样？是不是有种，被治愈了的感觉？多亏玫兰莎给我的样品，我才获得了这种灵感。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/0gazb8pw6m11i3rkey09xlzalprtucs.mp3","text":"谢谢您帮我建设花卉温室，我想，这里会是大家都能放松休息的好地方。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/mzgnqjtlsv7z86arga6i5fr9vxgnflh.mp3","text":"啊，您醒了吗？是不是一点疲惫都感觉不到了？看来我新调制的香薰起了作用。毕竟，这也算是我的自信之作呢。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/0v3x50ay8ullnrggzdea07iazr8grwr.mp3","text":"水仙、燕子花、长寿花、波罗尼——这些用来培育花朵的种子，我总是会随身携带的哦。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/fwrwa63d3s1lkawuc6rbtv1ffaophnx.mp3","text":"哎？您问这孩子吗？虽然它还很小，不过，她可总能在调制过程中帮上大忙呢。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/3t5dcjpvthzbtvwywh6rv63pbpk6gyv.mp3","text":"蚂蚁们的社会关系，是依靠气味来维持的吧？我觉得调香师和顾客的关系也是如此。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/qd6qk8regz0f6rt6q6qla4agm3hcytw.mp3","text":"最近您经常来温室做客呢......哎呀，您的袖口，沾着些花粉哟？好，已经帮您擦掉了~","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/70/py7739lrs4sahmpdc32a20kphu2gujl.mp3","text":"您好像睡了很久呢，这次，又做了什么样的梦呢？","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/h943eivdi62v44tx27blt6wj1jmvzew.mp3","text":"嗯，博士？哎，薰衣草的效果，超乎我的意料呢......","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/8yxt2icipmftacstunl1x6zu5kpxs2b.mp3","text":"初次见面，博士。我是调香师莱娜。您听说过调香师这种职业吗？","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/q8blx2outddagifbnkg4pt9qd4r35nn.mp3","text":"就拜托您检验我的成果了。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/p8nzql2isn2flf9jzb5cevtizo1fl48.mp3","text":"有关晋升的消息......您是特意来向我传达这个的吗？真是不好意思，博士......啊，抱歉，请稍等。没事，只是您的领角皱了，我稍微整理了一下~","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/kubav89wi4laizf9wvus2oofz25en9k.mp3","text":"其实我不太适合那些蛮不讲理的战斗方式。不过，如果是为了博士，我也是会去努力适应的。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/ifgqzlkmvunn6ps8jtmk98h4bxgvjn0.mp3","text":"非常乐意。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/p1hqdn2cijafag0ldfypxeeo2s2mrzu.mp3","text":"调香与治疗，无论哪一项工作，我都会让博士您满意的。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/blcxjuzplxe1mkfo2ih1xo5zknxo59o.mp3","text":"大家，千万要注意安全。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/n64rs5gnxc0x5qfrhegrbmdlgad6x53.mp3","text":"这会是一场怎样的战斗呢。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/t1u5ijk8hzoawtkas2mkllfw8k6yssn.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/f4wvt1yt27m907cf8c5p7ikyjtnqlbm.mp3","text":"我没问题的。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/lgeuj6ge01j314hhj8knzh3bj69kqt3.mp3","text":"这就是战场啊。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/26/itsuef0zzclj60mtbiqzo0f61awazqz.mp3","text":"我不会害怕的。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/kh1hjsgrs91pttrn2mzcpc6ew5wi692.mp3","text":"恢复神智吧。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/46vxip13566gad5da79b9k1pnm7365f.mp3","text":"打起精神来。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/69/5gyq4l50og2nmn7uojbtz60k1o6zkpi.mp3","text":"喜欢这种香味吗？","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/de/096ib6ojbdum7n5mouvfq9r3byw31le.mp3","text":"冷静一些哪。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/5wtjw7b69j4qktlr8rnhaec67dhmr9g.mp3","text":"我一直都相信啊，只要是博士来担任指挥的话，我们就一定会获胜的。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/j28h1hfas2vrzq6eka9ntktlhbsf3mt.mp3","text":"真是太好了，博士。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/2u66wvk0u1eolqi7cv0gyvkz7hnoomf.mp3","text":"大家辛苦了，请好好休息下吧。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/hiqgnr2i1jwwxl30s489fx7llkh59vr.mp3","text":"虽然没能赢下战斗确实有些遗憾，但我是不会气馁的。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/pigyi3o8efxj2pdbvr8i7ctevf7gstg.mp3","text":"还是博士的身边，最适合我呢。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/a5azbolcdlr6ncaktegkul7svi52cio.mp3","text":"哎呀。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/r6pmeuuzppb7ky76oe35sd8l91tx4nu.mp3","text":"博士身上......有着美妙的香气呢。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/co78ha437zpw2p11ujfedogi1egyf0u.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/nf5t243h41fid9ww8rzy812jbbkik30.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。新年用的花卉就放在这里，可以吗？这些花的花期虽然只有四天，但只要有我在，博士的房间里，一年四季都会充满花香与色彩的。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/e26fidlsb63edcbiepp22d4pdgrj59m.mp3","text":"博士，您好。","alt":"voice/char_181_flower/cn_042.mp3"}]}}